            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# CodexMate 0.0.54

- Restores unread indicators when a task completes while the thread list is refreshing.
- Clears unread state only after the thread is actually opened, avoiding background activity marking it as read.
- Keeps weekly usage in a neutral loading state when rate-limit data is temporarily unavailable.
]]></description>
